This is the order I use for an Alpha kernel:

          cd /usr/src/linux
          make menuconfig   (or make xconfig for GUI version)
          make dep
          make
          make modules
          make modules_install
          gzip < vmlinux > /boot/vmlinuz-2.2.17
          cp System.map /boot/System.map-2.2.17


Paul         



