You must load linload.exe and MILO directly from a file system that Windows
NT understands such as NTFS or Dos on a hard disk. (because of ARC mode)

example:

sda1 => ms-dos partition (*)
sda2 => /boot
sda3 => swap
sda4 => /

Milo Setup
LOADINDENTIFIER= Linux 6.2 for Alpha
SYSTEMPARTITION=scsi(0)disk(0)rdisk(0)partition(1)
OSLOADER=scsi(0)disk(0)rdisk(0)partition(1)\linload.exe
OSLOADPARTITION=scsi(0)disk(0)rdisk(0)partition(1)
OSLOADFILENAME=\milo
OSLOADOPTIONS=boot sda2:vmlinux.gz root=/dev/sda4

