Strongarm was acquired along with FAB6 by Intel 3.5 years ago, 90% of the
engineers walked rather than go work for Intel. Many went to AMD. Does any
one expect anything different to happen this time?

11) Where does this leave API? Will legacy manufacturing of Alpha processors
continue without Compaq?

12) What about http://www.compaq.com/alphaserver/news/commit_letter.html
Whoops!

13) How is this anything but an anti-competitive move by Intel to kill off
the only competition that would show how bad IA64 really is?

14) How long before Dell or Gateway buys Compaq for it's service business?


