I actually didn't see that the Alpha was "fast." I had an AS 400 with
the 233 MHz CPU. It wasn't particularly fast when compared to an x86 233
MHz CPU, or even an Ultra SPARC 167. I did find that the Alpha was twice
as fast running a Distributed.net client (I think it was a DES run), but
was slower in overall, everyday use for me. YMMV.

